  section.about-section
    h1 About Us
    br
    p. 
      Downtown Donuts began in the heart of downtown nearly 30 years ago, in 1992. Starting as a small family establishment focused on family 
      recipes and bringing people together, we have had the privilege of growing to multiple locations, but our focus has never changed. We 
      still pride ourselves on handcrafted donuts made fresh each morning, using the same family recipes that started this amazing journey. 
      We are committed to building our community and bringing people together, one donut at a time.
     